# .NET build output — НО держим в репо собранную CLI (kenshi-modtranslate),
# чтобы новичку не требовалось .NET SDK и соседний KenshiTranslator.
# Игнорируем ВСЁ в bin/, кроме каталожной цепочки и 4 нужных артефактов.
bin/*
!bin/Release/
bin/Release/*
!bin/Release/net9.0-windows/
bin/Release/net9.0-windows/*
!bin/Release/net9.0-windows/kenshi-modtranslate.dll
!bin/Release/net9.0-windows/KenshiCore.dll
!bin/Release/net9.0-windows/kenshi-modtranslate.runtimeconfig.json
!bin/Release/net9.0-windows/kenshi-modtranslate.deps.json
obj/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Runtime / кеш
state/
logs/
*.log

# Visual-check scratch (archify deliver / visual-check produces these)
docs/workflow.visual-check.*
docs/*.visual-check.html
docs/workflow.html.bak

# OS / IDE
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# LibreOffice / Excel lock files (иные каталоги)
.~lock*

# автоскачанный .NET runtime (install.py -- dotnet-local в папке проекта, без админа)
dotnet-local/

# Dev-time / migration artifacts (local only)
_dev/
_mods_inventory.json
_mods_inventory_pre_migration.json

# Web-research artifacts (local only)
ddg_cap[0-9].html
fandom_translating.txt
kz_page.html
